<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>For MJ 💌</title>

  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    *{
      margin:0;
      padding:0;
      box-sizing:border-box;
    }

    body{
      overflow:hidden;
      font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
      background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top left,#ffd6e7,transparent 40%),
      radial-gradient(circle at bottom right,#ffc2dc,transparent 40%),
      linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe3ee,#ffd3e6,#ffc9df);
      height:100vh;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      align-items:center;
      color:#fff;
      position:relative;
    }

    .vintage-overlay{
      position:absolute;
      inset:0;
      background-image:url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/flowers.png');
      opacity:0.15;
      pointer-events:none;
    }

    .container{
      width:90%;
      max-width:700px;
      text-align:center;
      z-index:2;
      animation:fade 1s ease;
    }

    .page{
      display:none;
      animation:fade 1s ease;
    }

    .active{
      display:block;
    }

    h1{
      font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
      font-size:4rem;
      font-weight:700;
      margin-bottom:25px;
      text-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      letter-spacing:2px;
    }

    p{
      font-size:1.2rem;
      line-height:1.9;
      color:#fffafc;
      padding:20px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
      border-radius:25px;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    button{
      margin-top:25px;
      padding:14px 35px;
      border:none;
      border-radius:50px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      color:white;
      font-size:1rem;
      cursor:pointer;
      backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
      transition:0.3s ease;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    button:hover{
      transform:scale(1.08);
      background:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    }

    @keyframes fade{
      from{
        opacity:0;
        transform:translateY(20px);
      }
      to{
        opacity:1;
        transform:translateY(0);
      }
    }

    /* HEARTS */

    .heart{
      position:absolute;
      bottom:-20px;
      color:#fff;
      font-size:20px;
      animation:float linear infinite;
      opacity:0.8;
    }

    @keyframes float{
      0%{
        transform:translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
        opacity:0;
      }
      20%{
        opacity:1;
      }
      100%{
        transform:translateY(-110vh) rotate(360deg);
        opacity:0;
      }
    }

    @media(max-width:600px){
      h1{
        font-size:2.5rem;
      }

      p{
        font-size:1rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="vintage-overlay"></div>

<div class="container">

  <!-- PAGE 1 -->
  <div class="page active">
    <h1>MJ FERI <3 I WANT TO SAY THAT...</h1>
    <button onclick="nextPage()">that?</button>
  </div>

  <!-- PAGE 2 -->
  <div class="page">
    <h1>I..</h1>
    <button onclick="nextPage()">i?</button>
  </div>

  <!-- PAGE 3 -->
  <div class="page">
    <h1>love..</h1>
    <button onclick="nextPage()">who😭!?</button>
  </div>

  <!-- PAGE 4 -->
  <div class="page">
    <h1>You 💗</h1>

    <p>
      A lot that i am keep thinking about you even jab aap mere sath hote
 ya mere sath nhi bhi hote you stays up in my mind 24/7 khwab mai bhi and i love that,
 you act like a figther to my bad or overthinking thoughts in my brain, 
you stay with me like a shadow be with me in any condition 
jab mai sad hu ya khush ya shant aap hamesha mere sath rehte and i love you for that,
 and if i start talking about your cuteness and beauty this page is not enough all i say that 
you own my heart my eyes no one is more beautifull or even likely beautifull / azeez for me jitna aap ho,
 mere sath rahei currently mai ye bana rha kyunki i miss you 
and i hope ki in future aap jab bhi ye msg padho to 
apne iss pyare se face pe ek pyari si smile se arsh ko bhi khush karde 
aur is dull world mai apni beautifull smile se shine laadei😭<3
 agar aap future mai padh rhe ho soo just a reminder ki arsh aapko ab bhi kaafi pyar karta hai aur karta rahega 
and i hope sab theek ho abhi humare beech mai
 koi dry chat or kuch na ho rha ho or if you misssing me right now
 my beautifull i'll be back soon mwah, i hope we stays together ~ my moon ~  


meri pyari jaan feriha. 
     </p>

  </div>

</div>

<script>
  const pages = document.querySelectorAll('.page');
  let current = 0;

  function nextPage(){
    pages[current].classList.remove('active');
    current++;

    if(current < pages.length){
      pages[current].classList.add('active');
    }
  }

  // HEART RAIN
  function createHeart(){
    const heart = document.createElement('div');
    heart.classList.add('heart');
    heart.innerHTML = '❤';

    heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';
    heart.style.animationDuration = (Math.random() * 3 + 4) + 's';
    heart.style.fontSize = (Math.random() * 20 + 15) + 'px';

    document.body.appendChild(heart);

    setTimeout(()=>{
      heart.remove();
    },7000);
  }

  setInterval(createHeart,250);
</script>

</body>
</html>
